%% OIP - Operational Intelligence Platform
%% Diagrama de Sequência e Arquitetura de Eventos (NATS JetStream & CloudEvents)

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Device as Câmeras / Dispositivos / Sensores
    participant Ingestion as Ingestion / Edge Gateway
    participant NATS as NATS JetStream (Barramento)
    participant AI as AI Runtime / Workers
    participant Core as Incident & Core Services
    participant DB as Event Store & Read Models
    participant UI as Dashboard Next.js / Realtime Gateway

    Device->>Ingestion: Stream RTSP / Áudio / Telemetria / IoT
    Ingestion->>NATS: Publica ingestão normalizada (ingestion.received)
    
    rect rgb(240, 245, 255)
        note right of NATS: Camada de Inteligência Operacional
        NATS->>AI: Consome stream/frame/áudio
        AI->>AI: Executa inferência (ONNX / Llama.cpp)
        AI->>NATS: Publica evento de capacidade (ai.detection.completed / capability.schema.json)
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 240)
        note right of NATS: Motor de Regras e Gestão de Incidentes
        NATS->>Core: Consome ai.detection.* via Consumer Groups
        Core->>DB: Persiste evento imutável (Event Sourcing)
        Core->>Core: Motor de Correlação e Deduplicação de Alertas
        Core->>DB: Atualiza Projeções Read Models (PostgreSQL/PostGIS)
        Core->>NATS: Publica incident.created / incident.status_updated
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        note right of NATS: Distribuição e Resposta Operacional
        NATS->>UI: Notifica via Realtime Gateway (WebSocket)
        UI->>Device: Exibe stream em tempo real via WebRTC (MediaMTX)
    end